    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726210/extras/9e2901deb0dc59c9a2200389467146ca.poster.avif?t=1699660213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726210/extras/9e2901deb0dc59c9a2200389467146ca.webm?t=1699660213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726210/extras/1838d3553a87bbad33faceb538e79a3b.avif?t=1699660213\" /></div><br>Potata: Foxy Tale will immerse you in a fascinating universe and explore the magical forest. The only way to save your homeland is to assemble the fragments of the Woodland Spirit. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726210/extras/0dcf1df57c66e7b2b4d80d8b2d4b88a5.avif?t=1699660213\" /></div><br>The fate of the forest and its inhabitants depend on a small yet feisty fox. The powers of Nature magic you hold in your paws will help you overcome any challenge on the way to save the world.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726210/extras/149766981e5e5b4dd4ef5adfface0036.avif?t=1699660213\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726210/extras/7fe8f773d091f33f81ddfb37f5386550.avif?t=1699660213\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A beautiful, hand-drawn world<br></li><li>You can alter the world with your abilities<br></li><li>A multitude of mysterious forest inhabitants<br></li><li>A relaxing, but engaging adventure</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726210/extras/9e2901deb0dc59c9a2200389467146ca.poster.avif?t=1699660213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726210/extras/9e2901deb0dc59c9a2200389467146ca.webm?t=1699660213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726210/extras/1838d3553a87bbad33faceb538e79a3b.avif?t=1699660213\" /></div><br>Potata: Foxy Tale will immerse you in a fascinating universe and explore the magical forest. The only way to save your homeland is to assemble the fragments of the Woodland Spirit. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726210/extras/0dcf1df57c66e7b2b4d80d8b2d4b88a5.avif?t=1699660213\" /></div><br>The fate of the forest and its inhabitants depend on a small yet feisty fox. The powers of Nature magic you hold in your paws will help you overcome any challenge on the way to save the world.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726210/extras/149766981e5e5b4dd4ef5adfface0036.avif?t=1699660213\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726210/extras/7fe8f773d091f33f81ddfb37f5386550.avif?t=1699660213\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A beautiful, hand-drawn world<br></li><li>You can alter the world with your abilities<br></li><li>A multitude of mysterious forest inhabitants<br></li><li>A relaxing, but engaging adventure</li></ul>",
